rafie](https://monoskop.org/images/2/25/Mitchell_WJT_1996_What_do_Pictures_Really_Want.pdf), [Domino](http://www.plunderphonics.com/xhtml/xplunder.html), [Sampling](https://www.iablis.de/acta-litterarum/autoren/monika-schmitz-emans/aufsaetze/acta-litterarum-monika-schmitz-emans-literarische-bilder-der-photographie), [NON-Design](https://arena-attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/2900434/3a86efda2f728a5b67c732a722c447b6.pdf),Multi-Authorship, Crowdsourcing, Audio & Image Re-Cycling, deconstruction

